# Sensitive product data — never commit.
# Directory rules are root-anchored on purpose: unanchored `audio/` or `exports/` would also
# silently ignore source packages such as `.../aidailymemory/audio/` or `backend/app/exports/`.
# The extension rules below are the repo-wide guard for audio files.
/recordings/
/audio/
/transcripts/
/exports/
*.wav
*.m4a
*.aac
*.opus
*.pcm
*.flac

# Runtime
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
/logs/
/tmp/
*.log
